<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Director of Ireland's Dragon Oil resigns.</title>
<headline>Director of Ireland's Dragon Oil resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish-based oil and exploration company Dragon Oil Plc said on Friday that Lars-Erik Magnusson had resigned as a Director of the Company with effect from May 12, 1997, in order to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377</p>
</text>
